<title>UK: Abbey National prices 250 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National prices 250 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase has been priced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT   *250 MLN STG   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    10.AUG.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.368    PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.125     REOFFER    97.368    SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LON/SI/HK PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
